WEBVTT

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.310
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.440
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.190
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.030
Shining Finger

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.900
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.740
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:26.420
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.670
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:40.100
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:48.440
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.730
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.240
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.330
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:04.080
Bright you now

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:08.580
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:10.920
Shining Finger

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.590
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:16.130
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:24.640
The Gundam Fight Begins!
The Gundam that Fell to Earth

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:29.520
The Gundam Fight Begins!
The Gundam that Fell to Earth

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:48.080
On this day, countless
shimmering objects were seen...

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:51.290
...hurtling toward Earth, a planet that once prided itself for its beauty.

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:54.300
One object went to Neo America.

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:56.300
One went to Neo China.

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:59.260
Another to Neo Russia,
and Neo France...

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:04.510
The objects looked like a
garden of beautiful flowers...

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:06.520
...each heading to what was
left of their homes on Earth.

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:07.770
However...

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:15.190
One of these glowing objects
had veered off its course.

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:43.090
It's arrived.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:54.610
That's the signal!

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:55.820
That's the signal!

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:59.860
The start of the Gundam Fight
that I've been waiting for so long!

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:25.050
Look at that. Does it have
a cooling device or something?

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:29.930
The guy must've thought he
was safe using his retrofire.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:32.600
You know it's totally ruined
this tourist site, Inspector.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:38.810
Yeah, but it's been going on
for 60 years now.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.240
What's the deal with this
Gundam Fight?

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:48.580
The guys in the Colonies don't care
what happens here on Earth.

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:52.460
What do they think Earth is,
anyway?

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:55.210
They probably just look at it
as a big ball of dirt...

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:58.500
...that's grown so filthy
it's unusable.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:00.710
Those are the times we live in.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:05.010
Now, let's go look
for the owner of this.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:05.680
Right!

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:10.560
Today's investigation revealed
that the meteorite which crashed...

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.230
...onto Spanish Square has to
do with the Gundam Fight.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:13.770
For this reason...

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:16.520
...the area within a 3-mile radius
of the fallen object...

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:19.090
...has been designated
a high-level danger zone.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.120
Listen up!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:37.170
The Gundam Fighter from that
meteorite is somewhere in the city!

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:38.540
Hunt him down!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:41.570
We'll use him as a scapegoat,
and at the same time...

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:43.300
...we'll celebrate the beginning
of the Gundam Fight!

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:45.010
Yeah!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.360
That's right.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.780
There's a weird stranger
just sitting here.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.690
Wow!

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:05.820
Just take a look at
all this money!

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:09.620
Forget it. These days it's just
nothing more than trash.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.280
This is what we want!

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:12.910
Hey, cool! Jewelry!

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:17.580
If we can get stuff like this, I hope
they keep having Gundam Fights.

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:22.840
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:26.260
Are you like some of the others
who've got no place to go to?

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:29.800
Well, once the Gundam Fight
gets underway...

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.430
...it really won't matter
where you run.

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:36.270
You wouldn't by chance have
seen this man around town?

00:05:38.140 --> 00:05:39.190
Can't say I have.

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:41.400
It would've been
about three months ago.

00:05:41.810 --> 00:05:42.940
Never seen him.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:45.280
I see.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.580
Excuse me.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:55.870
You dropped it, sir.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:58.970
Let me see.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:03.590
This is too precious for little brats.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:09.220
Hey, don't you think?
Mister?

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:16.770
Bro!

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.360
I'll get you, you little...!

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.380
You bastard!

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:09.070
Tell me.
Is this guy part of your group?!

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:12.780
Spit it out!

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.830
Now, hold it right there.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.890
All we really want is for you...

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:44.060
...to hit the road so the city
doesn't get demolished.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:50.780
How about it?
You must be hungry.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:55.620
Don't hold back.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:59.540
Admit you're a Gundam Fighter and
you can have as much as you want.

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:06.170
Inspector, someone's here
to bail him out.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:06.960
What?

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.420
Domon Kasshu.

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:15.930
Citizen of Neo Japan.

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.470
Traveling as a tourist.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:24.480
In any case, get out of
this city within the hour.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:25.340
Got it?

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:33.820
Come on.

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:37.370
If you hadn't forgotten that,
they wouldn't have suspected you.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:42.600
What?

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:45.960
Brother...

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:52.010
But these people sure do
hate Gundam Fights...

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:55.970
...with the place getting more
damaged every time there's a battle.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:57.930
I suppose...

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:00.890
...we'll have to get used to it.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.890
Especially with the
situation we're in.

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:09.730
I'm sorry.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:11.610
But, you know...

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.110
Hey, mister!

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:21.030
We just heard from the cops
that they let you go.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.540
Here. Take these.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.290
They're for you.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.290
To thank you for
saving us back there.

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:35.280
Well, actually somebody at the
bakery just left them outside.

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.010
Thank you.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:43.310
But did you children get
separated from your parents?

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:44.770
You'd better hurry and evacuate.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:47.690
Our parents...

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:50.240
...were lost during the
last Gundam Fight...

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:52.110
I see.

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:55.150
How about you guys
stay with us tonight?

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:02.870
Right.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.680
Even the hotel workers
have taken off.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:09.120
You'd better watch out though.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:13.540
I bet you they ran to their boss
Michelo and told him about you.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:16.880
Do you know this Michelo guy?

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:20.720
Are you kidding?
He's our nation's Gundam Fighter.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:25.060
But actually,
he used to be a Mafia boss.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.180
And ever since he
became a Fighter...

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:28.980
...he does whatever he wants.

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:33.190
How can a guy like that
represent our country?

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:34.730
Because he's strong.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:37.560
That's right!

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:42.400
- What's going on?
- Get back!

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:58.920
A Gundam!

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:08.980
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.550
A Gundam?!

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:19.650
It seems you've been
a bit rowdy with my men.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:23.190
Huh? Neo Japan Fighter?

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:25.990
I'll have to pay you back for that!

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.240
With my feet!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:38.170
Well, I guess you weren't chosen
as a Gundam Fighter for nothing!

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:43.300
Wait! Take a look at this first!

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:44.930
It's Sophia!

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:49.270
If you want her back...

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:51.810
...come to our base alone!

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:55.190
Don't think about bringing
your Gundam with you!

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:58.860
Of course, that's if you can
get out of here alive.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.690
Fire! Neros Gundam!

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:05.530
- Do it, Rain!
- Right!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.210
Hey, what's all the noise?!

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.470
They've already started...

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:32.710
Is he gone now?

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:34.640
I think we're safe now.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:43.700
How could he activate his Gundam
before the beginning of the Fight?

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:49.080
I'm sorry.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:50.740
But don't you worry.

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:53.910
I'll talk to the
Gundam Fight Committee.

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:55.250
Don't bother.

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:58.460
It's not in the regulations.
Talking will get you nowhere.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:00.040
Then what'll happen to Sophia?!

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:02.300
That's not my problem.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.720
All I'm prepared to do is fight him.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:08.050
I can't allow that.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:12.270
I'm not going to watch you guys
destroy this city any further...

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:13.770
...Gundam Fighter.

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:20.690
Mezzina!
Watch these two!

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:21.400
Right!

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:25.650
It's my job to rescue hostages.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:41.420
Do you really think
that guy's going to come?

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:42.630
Yeah.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.840
He'll definitely be here.

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.570
Hey, didn't you say you
were going to rescue Sophia?

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:03.860
Just be quiet!

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:07.530
Listen. This never would happen
if those guys weren't here!

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.370
That's right.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.950
Gundam Fighters are
nothing but scum.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:15.040
By getting rid of the scum...

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:15.750
He's here!

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:17.620
He came, Boss!

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:34.810
The bastard...

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:38.600
Stop! I said, stop!

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:41.560
Why, you!

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:42.980
- Andre!
- Yeah!

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:45.530
No...!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:52.990
No! Sophia!

00:14:58.500 --> 00:14:59.290
Fire!

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:17.520
That crest!

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:20.060
The martial arts champion
of the Colonies...

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:23.770
...the King of Hearts,
Domon Kasshu!

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:28.650
You've got to be kidding.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:30.280
Boss!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.610
We don't stand a chance
if we fight this guy!

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:34.530
Shut up!

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:36.660
Rise up!

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:38.370
Neros Gundam!

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:44.750
Here!

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:47.380
Sophia!

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.550
You all right?!

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:53.930
I'll crush you for sure this time!

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:55.850
Rain! Now!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:06.900
Rise! Shining Gundam!

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:24.790
So, there it is!

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:52.690
Mobile Trace System checking
brainwaves, blood pressure...

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:56.240
...pulse, respiration, temperature,
metabolism. All green.

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.730
Gundam Fight
combat signal confirmed!

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:31.090
The 13th Tournament is now
authorized to commence!

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:35.280
In that case, Gundam Fight!
Standby!

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:38.280
Ready! Go!

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:45.330
I can't believe they went ahead
with the match!

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:49.460
You're not getting away!

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.010
Take this!

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:07.100
He's hiding from me.

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:10.980
Then I'll have to force him out
with these silver feet!

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.570
Chesto!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:37.550
The scum!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:41.220
But, you saw how
that man saved me.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.220
No.
I want you to look very carefully.

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:47.020
The Colonies decided to have
competitions to avoid all-out war.

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:50.770
Each sends a Gundam
representing their Colony nations...

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:53.110
...and they fight each other
on Earth.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:57.200
And they fight! And they fight!
And they continue fighting!

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:00.660
Until the nation represented
by the last standing Gundam...

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:03.880
...earns the right to
rule all of space.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.250
They're totally insane.

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:12.380
They think of the planet Earth
as nothing but a playground.

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:13.670
But think.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.430
What happens to the people
who remain here?

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:19.760
When I was a young boy
about your age...

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:27.470
That day...

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:31.690
...I stood and watched those guys
leave us behind and fly to space.

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:34.020
I understood only too well...

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:37.030
...that from that day,
we were forsaken.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:39.280
But not now.

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:43.280
I won't let them toy with Earth.
At least not this city!

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:45.420
Not where we were born
and raised!

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:02.010
Wh-what?!

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:04.930
You may have those silver feet.

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:07.140
But I've got these gold fingers!

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:13.440
Here I go!

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:18.650
Shining finger!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.700
Article 1 of the Gundam Fight
International Regulations!

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:33.850
"A unit whose head section has
been destroyed is disqualified!"

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:39.920
I'm not done.

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:42.340
I've got something to ask you!

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:49.350
What's going on?

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.730
Do you know this man?!

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:55.640
N-never seen him!

00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:02.030
I don't know him! I don't!
I've never seen him in my life!

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:03.110
I see.

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:08.120
Article 2 of the Gundam Fight
International Regulations!

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:13.330
"A pilot must never aim at the
cockpit of an opponent!"

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:21.590
At least you didn't lose your life...

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:23.630
...Michelo Chariot.

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:34.560
Now that he's disqualified
as a Gundam Fighter...

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:35.830
...he's just an ordinary man.

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:38.230
He's going...

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:42.450
But, Miss.
Aren't you going to go with him?

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:46.570
I have to stay and do some
repairs on the Gundam.

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:49.200
Don't worry.
He's only got one destination.

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:52.290
And it's on this Earth.

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:58.210
Gundam Fighter Domon Kasshu!

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:02.050
It's the pizza I promised you.

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:11.270
The dawn of the Gundam Fight.

00:22:11.820 --> 00:22:14.720
This is going be one of
those awful years.

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:33.080
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:37.460
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:41.920
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:45.460
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:52.640
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:58.350
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:03.610
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:10.150
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.530 --> 00:23:14.280
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:20.290
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:32.850
It's the moment you've
been waiting for!

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:36.470
Chibodee Crocket, the man who
achieved the American Dream...

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:38.790
...has returned to his hometown
of New York.

00:23:38.790 --> 00:23:41.690
Domon Kasshu,
with his Shining Gundam...

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:43.150
...challenges the Gundam Maxter.

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:46.520
But some very devious men
have been hatching a plot.

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:49.690
And they intend to set a
wicked trap to catch Domon.

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:53.070
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:55.860
Roar of the Winning Punch.

00:23:54.720 --> 00:24:00.920
Roar of the Winning Punch!

00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:59.370
Ready! Go!
